<title>CHINA: China signs $400mln power plant deal with Malaysia.</title>
<headline>China signs $400mln power plant deal with Malaysia.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China has signed a deal with a Malaysian consortium to build a $400 million power plant in the southeast Asian nation, the official Xinhua news agency said on Friday.</p>
</text>
